<title>USA: Uncle B's Bakery in dough supply pact.</title>
<headline>Uncle B's Bakery in dough supply pact.</headline>
<dateline>ELLSWORTH, Iowa 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uncle B's Bakery Inc said Tuesday it signed a three-year agreement with New York Bagel Enterprises Inc to supply frozen bagel dough.</p>
<p>Initial distribution to 12 company owned New York Bagel restaurants is expected to commence in June. Annual sales based on the initial distribution could reach $2 million.</p>
<p>Uncle B's Bakery produces and markets the Uncle B's and Millspring brands of fresh bagels. The company's products are sold in more than 11,000 supermarkets in 43 states.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
